+# Grouped M2 local decoder credit V1
+
+The fresh CPU implementation now has bounded native qualification. See
+[measured qualification and limits](QUALIFICATION.md); no scientific learning
+study or trained-brain claim follows. The chronology below preserves earlier
+source-only status and failed assertions rather than rewriting their history. The base is fbf2a517f93098b5d936878a3d26bbb8d0391c38. The original
+closed host and all prior direct learning paths retain their identities and
+behavior. This is a fresh CPU research admission, not a migration or GPU feature.
+The independent six-weight taste-reference repair is deliberately excluded.
+
+## Declared law: bounded score trace, fast decoder only
+
+For source ActionCandidate and MemoryContext decoder coordinates only:
+
+    g_i = d log pi(actual sampled grouped joint action) / d w_effective_i
+    E_i = clamp(rho_i^elapsed * previous_E_i + g_i, -1, 1)
+    U_i = rho_i^outcome_delay * E_i
+    F_i' = clamp(F_i + eta_i * alpha_i * m_i * U_i, fast_min_i, fast_max_i)
+
+The single categorical pullback includes representative, all genuinely sampled
+channels and the conditional operation exactly once, with native temperature,
+masks, common Rest source readout, M2/group soma Jacobians, and operation-specific
+memory clamp slopes. Actual source activations and receipt from its one execution
+are used. No detached source is rebuilt and no common memory is invented.
+
+`m_i` is the inherited receptor projection of the canonical sealed joint outcome
+with its matching biochemical frame. Developmental parameters are validated by
+the existing developmental adapter. Its existing route scaling/caps apply only
+to recurrent coordinates, so decoder eta remains the inherited receptor rate.
+
+This new rule deliberately does not call the old waking_fast_update law. That
+law includes signed-credit-weighted Oja normalization with post^2 * effective
+weight. Here normalization is CLOSED, not reinterpreted. No extra pre/post factor
+is multiplied into a derivative already containing the decoder input/source
+activation. Bounded eligibility, receptor projections and temporal association
+mean this is not an exact policy-gradient optimizer, recurrent BPTT, or trained
+brain claim. Aggregate outcome is joint association, not isolated channel reward.
+
+Only fast and eligibility banks on those declared decoder coordinates may change.
+Lifetime, recurrent/speech/CognitiveContext eligibility and weights, optimizer
+weights/moments/integer ages, acquired dendrites and structural banks remain
+bit-identical. Synaptic sleep replay/staging is closed. Canonical memory,
+predictor, body and memory-sleep transactions are retained unchanged. Weight
+generation advances only when fast values actually change. Memory-sleep has a
+distinct identity and records its real cycle, never a fake weight generation.
+
+## Evidence and resource plan
+
+Work is isolated in grouped-m2-decoder-credit-v1. No build/native execution is
+allowed until the coordinator releases a lane and confirms disk capacity.
+No study seed is selected or consumed. The reserved closed Full/DriveSham pair
+and active runs are untouched. First source worktree is approximately 154 MiB;
+new source/docs are expected below 1 MiB and no target is allocated.
+
+Qualification must include a real own-world sealed cost/relief/harm receipt,
+closed same-source control, exact cold continuation with acquired state, declared
+write-coordinate checks, malformed/duplicate provenance rejection, finite
+differences at nonunit temperature and clipped contexts, clearly labeled
+synthetic zero/opposite controls, and a same-frame logit effect separated from
+alternative real trajectories. No sustained avoidance or fitness claim follows
+from a one-step weight change.
+
+Methodological reference: https://rikiyat.github.io/blog/weight-space-programming/
+Experiment 4 motivates targeted repair, experiment 5 whole-controller integration,
+and experiment 6 feedback/iteration. They do not validate this biological law.
+
+## Iteration record
+
+1. Source review: the direct stage_selection path is not the grouped derivative;
+   the closed host's source tape and native Jacobians provide a correct seam.
+2. Initial law above was reported to the coordinator before implementation.
